              "agent_3": "The individual you are looking for is **Pouneh Shabani-Jadidi**. \n\nHere are the details that match your criteria:\n- As of December 2023, she is the coordinator of a research group founded in 2009.\n- She co-edited a book published in 2018 by Routledge, titled \"The Oxford Handbook of Persian Linguistics.\"\n- One of her co-editors, who was a keynote speaker at a conference in 2019, is Seth M. Holmes.\n- She served as the convenor of a panel before 2020.\n- She published an article in 2012.\n- She completed her PhD on the writings of an English writer.\n\nFor more information, you can view her academic bio [here](https://mes.uchicago.edu/pouneh-shabani-jadidi).",
